{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Guess who just got back[Cm]  today
[Db]  Them wildeyed boys that [Fm]had been away
[Cm]  Haven't changed that [Fm]much to say
[Bbm]   But man, I still think [Db/Eb]them cats are crazy
[Ab]  They were askin'[Cm]  if you were around
[Db]  How you was, where [E]you could be found
[Cm]  Told 'em you were li[Fm]vin' downtown
[Bbm]   Drivin' all the old men [Db/Eb]crazy
{end_of_verse}


